        <owl:disjointWith rdf:resource="https://saref.etsi.org/saref4wear/WearableDevice"/>
        <rdfs:comment>A broad term that includes diseases, illnesses, disorders, defects and dysfunctions.</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:comment>All subclasses of this class are punned such that they are both classes and individuals. &quot;In OWL 2 the same name can be used for a class, a property and an individual, a feature known as punning.&quot;</rdfs:comment>
        <rdfs:label>Medical condition</rdfs:label>
    </owl:Class>
    <owl:Axiom>
